                <h3><figure class="post__image post__image--full"><img loading="lazy"  src="https://rebeen-art.github.io/rebeen/media/posts/3/2-A-walk-from-and-to-home-copy-copy.jpg" alt="" width="6378" height="638" sizes="(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 768px" srcset="https://rebeen-art.github.io/rebeen/media/posts/3/responsive/2-A-walk-from-and-to-home-copy-copy-xs.jpg 300w ,https://rebeen-art.github.io/rebeen/media/posts/3/responsive/2-A-walk-from-and-to-home-copy-copy-sm.jpg 480w ,https://rebeen-art.github.io/rebeen/media/posts/3/responsive/2-A-walk-from-and-to-home-copy-copy-md.jpg 768w ,https://rebeen-art.github.io/rebeen/media/posts/3/responsive/2-A-walk-from-and-to-home-copy-copy-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://rebeen-art.github.io/rebeen/media/posts/3/responsive/2-A-walk-from-and-to-home-copy-copy-xl.jpg 1360w ,https://rebeen-art.github.io/rebeen/media/posts/3/responsive/2-A-walk-from-and-to-home-copy-copy-2xl.jpg 1600w"></figure></h3>
<p><em>Photo: Juli Adnan 2009</em></p>
<p>The work is a performance made in sulaymaniyeh City. In one of districkts which unplanned for expansion of the city happened, but the government didn’t provide services for those blocks. Beside Rebeen says that he had a problem with the back of his trousers getting muddy, something related to his way of walking; even though he tries hard to avoid it. </p>
<p>On the day of the performance, he gets out from the home of Juli Adnan his friend, and walk for 17 minutes from home of his friend and goes back with his friend Juli Adnan who is also a profesional photographer taking a photo each minute of his trousers back.</p>
<figure class="post__image post__image--wide"><img loading="lazy"  src="https://rebeen-art.github.io/rebeen/media/posts/3/2-A-walk-from-and-to-home-face-book-jpg-3.jpg" alt="" width="2399" height="638" sizes="(max-width: 48em) 100vw, 768px" srcset="https://rebeen-art.github.io/rebeen/media/posts/3/responsive/2-A-walk-from-and-to-home-face-book-jpg-3-xs.jpg 300w ,https://rebeen-art.github.io/rebeen/media/posts/3/responsive/2-A-walk-from-and-to-home-face-book-jpg-3-sm.jpg 480w ,https://rebeen-art.github.io/rebeen/media/posts/3/responsive/2-A-walk-from-and-to-home-face-book-jpg-3-md.jpg 768w ,https://rebeen-art.github.io/rebeen/media/posts/3/responsive/2-A-walk-from-and-to-home-face-book-jpg-3-lg.jpg 1024w ,https://rebeen-art.github.io/rebeen/media/posts/3/responsive/2-A-walk-from-and-to-home-face-book-jpg-3-xl.jpg 1360w ,https://rebeen-art.github.io/rebeen/media/posts/3/responsive/2-A-walk-from-and-to-home-face-book-jpg-3-2xl.jpg 1600w"></figure>
